"Each app has custom notification settings that determine where their notifications are allowed to show (in Settings —> Notifications). This menu allows you to restrict Pusher to only send a notification if the app's notification settings have either all (AND) or at least one (OR) of the selected options below. Selecting AND requires all of the enabled options below to be enabled in the app's settings. Selecting OR requires only one of the enabled options below to be enabled in the app's settings." = "每个应用都有自定义通知设置，用于决定其通知允许显示的位置（在“设置 —> 通知”中）。此菜单可以限制 Pusher 仅在应用通知设置满足以下所有（AND）或至少一个（OR）选项时才发送通知。选择 AND 要求下方所有已启用选项在应用设置中都为开启；选择 OR 只要求下方任意一个已启用选项在应用设置中为开启。";
"When using OR, you will probably want to require that Allow Notifications is enabled in the app's notification settings in addition to other settings. This is because the device saves the rest of the settings (e.g. Lock Screen, Badges, etc.) even when you turn off Allow Notifications in the app's notification settings. For example, if you install a new app and don't allow push notifications, the rest of the settings still default to on. If you select OR, Lock Screen, and Sounds below for example, even the apps that hide all notifications will be sent through Pusher. This fixes that. When this option is on, you will probably want to disable the 'Allow Notifications' switch below. If you are confused, leave this setting on." = "使用“任一”时，你可能还需要要求应用通知设置中的“允许通知”为开启。这是因为即使关闭应用的“允许通知”，设备仍会保存其余设置（如锁定屏幕、标记等）。例如，安装新应用且不允许推送通知时，其余设置仍默认开启。如果选择“任一”并同时选择“锁定屏幕”和“声音”，即使应用隐藏了所有通知，也仍会通过 Pusher 发送。此选项可以解决该问题。开启此选项后，你可能需要关闭下方的“允许通知”开关。如果感到困惑，请保持此设置开启。";
